About Project :-->
This project includes how to create VPC in prod environment . 
To improve resiliency you deploy servers in two avalibality zones,by using Autoscaling group and
application LB.
for additional security , you deploy servers in private subnet.
Servers receive request from LB , servers can connect to internet by using NAT gateway,
To imporve resliency NAT gateway deployed in both availability zones. 

Why NAT gateway used ?
-->
NAT gateway is used in public subnet coz if application from private subnet wants to access something from internet then private IP should not be exposed.
so private ip gets masked with NAT IP in public subnet and then content will be accessed .

HOW TO CONNECT TO PRIVATE EC2 INSTANCE OR APP??
==>
USER LOCAL SYSTEM (with private key) ==> JUMP SERVER (configur private key in this server as well)  ==> PRIVATE EC2 APP
KEY PAIR COPY FROM LOCAL INSIDE JUMP SERVER AND FROM THEIR KEY PAIR WE CONNECT TO PROD APP IN PRIVATE EC2.


